  "decision": "Do not add a third GU common Manifest source yet. GU meets the Play Booster support skeleton: two monocolour commons, at least two useful monocolour uncommons across the pair (including direct Manifest and voyage/exile bridges), and two multicolour signposts. The stress model shows GU is substantially more competition-sensitive than WU/WB, so actual draft/pool testing remains mandatory. A new common is reopened only if real drafts cannot assemble the lane when GU is plausibly open.",
